<div id="S3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p7.1" class="ltx_p">Finally, Table <a href="#S3.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Scoring Methodology. ‣ 3 Skills Profile for GPT-5 thinking and Comparison with o4-mini-high ‣ GAUSS: Benchmarking Structured Mathematical Skills for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> presents the <em id="S3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">SubScores</em> for each skill category in a heat-map style,
accompanied by concise descriptions of strengths and weaknesses.
This representation highlights both quantitative performance and qualitative patterns in GPT-5-thinking’s mathematical abilities.</p>
</div>
