<span id="S3.T3.5.29.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.5.29.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Extracts key ideas from technical texts.</span>
</span></td></tr>
