<span id="S3.T3.5.30.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T3.5.30.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFC8C8;">0</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T3.5.30.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T3.5.30.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="S3.T3.5.30.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Struggles to independently study.</span>
