<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Evaluation Pipeline</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present a structured evaluation framework for benchmarking the mathematical reasoning ability of large language models (LLMs), with a focus on <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">GPT-5-thinking</span>. Each task is processed through a well-defined pipeline that records the problem, generates a model response, compares it with a standard solution, and evaluates the result based on a rubric.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We use the following environments to organize the content:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Problem Statement</span> — <span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">problembox</span> <span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#006666;">(Blue box)</span>
Each task begins with a well-defined mathematical problem enclosed in a blue-framed <span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">problembox</span>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Usage:</span></p><pre id="A1.I1.i1.p2.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">
\begin{problembox}{Problem Title}
Problem description goes here.
\end{problembox}
    
</pre>
</div>
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.I1.i1.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="69.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 429.64 69.62" width="429.64"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,69.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#3D6666;" fill="#3D6666" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.63 L 0 65 C 0 67.55 2.07 69.62 4.63 69.62 L 425.01 69.62 C 427.56 69.62 429.64 67.55 429.64 65 L 429.64 4.63 C 429.64 2.07 427.56 0 425.01 0 L 4.63 0 C 2.07 0 0 2.07 0 4.63 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 4.63 L 0.69 50.76 L 428.94 50.76 L 428.94 4.63 C 428.94 2.45 427.18 0.69 425.01 0.69 L 4.63 0.69 C 2.45 0.69 0.69 2.45 0.69 4.63 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 55.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:24.44em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="338.18"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:24.44em;">
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Problem</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 14.66)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.06em;--ltx-fo-height:1.76em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.16em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.44" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 24.29)" width="457.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.06em;">
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Problem Title
Problem description goes here.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model Response (GPT-5-thinking)</span> — <span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">GPT-5-thinking-response</span> environment
The answer generated by <span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">o4-mini-high</span> is typeset in a proof-style environment to simulate a student’s written work. It avoids colored boxes for a cleaner academic appearance.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Usage:</span></p><pre id="A1.I1.i2.p2.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">
\begin{GPT-5-thinking-response}
Model-generated response goes here.
\end{GPT-5-thinking-response}
    
</pre>
</div>
<div id="A1.I1.i2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof"><span id="A1.I1.i2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Response of GPT-5-thinking</span>.</h6>
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Model-generated response goes here.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Standard Solution</span> — <span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">solution</span> environment
The correct or ideal solution is presented using a similar proof-style layout for comparison with the model output.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Usage:</span></p><pre id="A1.I1.i3.p2.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">
\begin{solution}
Standard solution goes here.
\end{solution}
    
</pre>
</div>
<div id="A1.I1.i3.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof"><span id="A1.I1.i3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Standard Solution</span>.</h6>
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">Standard solution goes here.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Grading Rubric</span> — <span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">rubricbox</span> <span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#4D4D4D;">(Gray box)</span>
The evaluation rubric is provided in a blue-framed <span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">rubricbox</span>, outlining the criteria for full and partial credit.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i4.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Usage:</span></p><pre id="A1.I1.i4.p2.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">
\begin{rubricbox}
1. States and proves the correct minimum value — 2 point. \\
2. Gives a correct construction — 2 point.
\end{rubricbox}
    
</pre>
</div>
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.I1.i4.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="69.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 429.64 69.62" width="429.64"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,69.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4D4D;" fill="#4D4D4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.63 L 0 65 C 0 67.55 2.07 69.62 4.63 69.62 L 425.01 69.62 C 427.56 69.62 429.64 67.55 429.64 65 L 429.64 4.63 C 429.64 2.07 427.56 0 425.01 0 L 4.63 0 C 2.07 0 0 2.07 0 4.63 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 4.63 L 0.69 50.76 L 428.94 50.76 L 428.94 4.63 C 428.94 2.45 427.18 0.69 425.01 0.69 L 4.63 0.69 C 2.45 0.69 0.69 2.45 0.69 4.63 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 55.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:24.44em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="338.18"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.I1.i4.p3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:24.44em;">
<span id="A1.I1.i4.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i4.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Rubric</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 14.66)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.06em;--ltx-fo-height:1.76em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.16em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.44" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 24.29)" width="457.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.I1.i4.p3.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.06em;">
<span id="A1.I1.i4.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i4.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. States and proves the correct lower bound — 2 point. 
<br class="ltx_break">2. Gives a correct construction — 2 point.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Scoring and Feedback</span></p>
<ul id="A1.I1.i5.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">scorebox</span> <span id="A1.I1.i5.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#004D4D;">(Teal box)</span> — Records the numerical score assigned.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i5.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">evalbox</span> <span id="A1.I1.i5.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#B30000;">(Red box)</span> — Contains qualitative evaluator feedback.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i5.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Usage:</span></p><pre id="A1.I1.i5.p2.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">
\begin{scorebox}
Score: 0 / 3
\end{scorebox}

\begin{evalbox}
The model correctly applied the s-cobordism theorem...
\end{evalbox}
    
</pre>
</div>
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.I1.i5.p3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="54.13" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 429.64 54.13" width="429.64"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,54.13) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#5A996B;" fill="#5A996B" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.63 L 0 49.51 C 0 52.06 2.07 54.13 4.63 54.13 L 425.01 54.13 C 427.56 54.13 429.64 52.06 429.64 49.51 L 429.64 4.63 C 429.64 2.07 427.56 0 425.01 0 L 4.63 0 C 2.07 0 0 2.07 0 4.63 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F6FFF9;" fill="#F6FFF9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 4.63 L 0.69 35.38 L 428.94 35.38 L 428.94 4.63 C 428.94 2.45 427.18 0.69 425.01 0.69 L 4.63 0.69 C 2.45 0.69 0.69 2.45 0.69 4.63 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 40.01)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:24.44em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.49" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.49)" width="338.18"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
