</span><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.16093" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><em class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Multiple chordal SLE(<math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">κ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa</annotation></semantics></math>) and quantum Calogero–Moser system</em></a><span id="A2.SS1.SSS2.Px1.p57.pic1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="A2.SS1.SSS2.Px1.p57.pic1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[</span><a href="#bib.bib16" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhang, 2025</a><span id="A2.SS1.SSS2.Px1.p57.pic1.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">]</span></cite><span id="A2.SS1.SSS2.Px1.p57.pic1.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
