<span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.Px1.p55.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.Px1.p55.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. Commutation of curves imply commutation of generators</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.Px1.p55.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.Px1.p55.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. Derive the existence of null vector PDEs from commutation of generators.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
