<span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.Px1.p57.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.Px1.p57.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. Fail to derive the commutation relations of generators from commutation relations of curves.</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.Px1.p57.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.Px1.p57.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. Fail to derive the existence of parition function and null vector PDEs.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
