</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 14.66)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.06em;--ltx-fo-height:7.76em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.16em;font-size:10pt;" height="109.47" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 107.31)" width="457.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS7.SSS4.Px2.p7.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.06em;">
<span id="A2.SS7.SSS4.Px2.p7.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS7.SSS4.Px2.p7.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1 point for preferring Solution 2.
<br class="ltx_break">1 point for a consistent explanation (no matter which preference). For preferring Solution 2, mentioning that it is <span id="A2.SS7.SSS4.Px2.p7.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">basis-free</span> or <span id="A2.SS7.SSS4.Px2.p7.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">intrinsic</span> earns the point.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
