<div id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p58" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p58.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p58.1.1" class="ltx_text">The only values of <math id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p58.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> which give “mountain" sequences are <math id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p58.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=1,3,15" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=1,3,15</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p59" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p59.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p59.1.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p60" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p60.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="69.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 429.64 69.62" width="429.64"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,69.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#4D4D4D;" fill="#4D4D4D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.63 L 0 65 C 0 67.55 2.07 69.62 4.63 69.62 L 425.01 69.62 C 427.56 69.62 429.64 67.55 429.64 65 L 429.64 4.63 C 429.64 2.07 427.56 0 425.01 0 L 4.63 0 C 2.07 0 0 2.07 0 4.63 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 4.63 L 0.69 50.76 L 428.94 50.76 L 428.94 4.63 C 428.94 2.45 427.18 0.69 425.01 0.69 L 4.63 0.69 C 2.45 0.69 0.69 2.45 0.69 4.63 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 55.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:24.44em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="338.18"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p60.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:24.44em;">
<span id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p60.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p60.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Rubric</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 14.66)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.06em;--ltx-fo-height:1.76em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.16em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.44" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 24.29)" width="457.46"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p60.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.06em;">
<span id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p60.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p60.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. Correctly formulate what makes a sequence a clock sequence.</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p60.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p60.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. Correctly explain how clock sequences are generated.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p61" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS11.SSS2.Px2.p61.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="54.13" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 429.64 54.13" width="429.64"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,54.13) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#5A996B;" fill="#5A996B" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.63 L 0 49.51 C 0 52.06 2.07 54.13 4.63 54.13 L 425.01 54.13 C 427.56 54.13 429.64 52.06 429.64 49.51 L 429.64 4.63 C 429.64 2.07 427.56 0 425.01 0 L 4.63 0 C 2.07 0 0 2.07 0 4.63 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F6FFF9;" fill="#F6FFF9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 4.63 L 0.69 35.38 L 428.94 35.38 L 428.94 4.63 C 428.94 2.45 427.18 0.69 425.01 0.69 L 4.63 0.69 C 2.45 0.69 0.69 2.45 0.69 4.63 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 40.01)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:24.44em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.49" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.49)" width="338.18"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
